  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nON RECRUIT / ALTAR CREATION:
    gain 6 eggs immediately once. Merely keeping this ally does not grant 6 eggs
    every wave.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Collision frequency: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA map maker who drew windows
    for a district with none. One drawing opened a real passage. They now check every
    imagined exit before sharing it, and want to draw somewhere from life rather
    than longing.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s, chill enemies within 2.313 units:
    1.5s normally, 0.6s on bosses.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: archive, resolve.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
